+## Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=mermaid-js%2Fmermaid-live-editor)
+
+Wasmer runs `pnpm install` and `pnpm run build`, then serves the generated `docs/` folder (set in the `Staticfile`) as static files, using the defaults from `.env`. The button opens Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the configuration and click Deploy; it does not create a copy of the repository in your GitHub account.
+
 ## Setup
 
 Below link will help you making a copy of the repository in your local system.
